          "Fixed missing language keys in LangLoader that caused repeated [LangLoader] Missing key warnings in the console whenever a user clicked or double-clicked on an instance",
          "Added keys: js.landing.instances.deleteTooltip, js.landing.instances.alreadyLaunchingTitle, js.landing.instances.alreadyLaunchingBody, js.landing.instances.alreadyLaunchingConfirm, js.landing.instances.alreadyLaunchingCancel, js.instanceManager.playtimeTooltip to all language files"
        ],
        "changed": [
          "Reworked the loading screen with a new visual design to improve the overall user experience during startup",
          "General launcher performance was improved, resulting in significantly faster startup times, reduced freezes, and smoother overall behavior across all interactions"
        ],
        "added": [
          "Added support for the latest Minecraft versions running under the Vulkan graphics API, ensuring compatibility with modern rendering pipelines"
        ]
      },
